{"id":"73249160be424f80","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/541_Gödel–Löb_逻辑.md","title":"541 Gödel–Löb 逻辑","display":"541_Gödel–Löb_逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{pr}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{pr}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号与缩写为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Pr A=\\operatorname{pr}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Pr A=\\operatorname{pr}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond_{\\Pr}A:=\\neg\\Pr\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Diamond_{\\Pr}A:=\\neg\\Pr\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{541}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{541})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{541}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{541})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{pr}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(\\operatorname{pr}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{541}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。无绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{541}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{541}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,541}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{541}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{541}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,541}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{541}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{541})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{541}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{541})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{541}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{541}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{pr}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{pr}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{pr}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{pr}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{541}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{541}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{541}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{541}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{541}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{541}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{541}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{541}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{541}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可证性分配、自反迭代与 Löb 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr(A\\to B)\\to(\\Pr A\\to\\Pr B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr(A\\to B)\\to(\\Pr A\\to\\Pr B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr A\\to\\Pr\\Pr A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr A\\to\\Pr\\Pr A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr(\\Pr A\\to A)\\to\\Pr A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr(\\Pr A\\to A)\\to\\Pr A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{541}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{541}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{541}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{541}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{541}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>分离与可证性推广分别显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Pr A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Pr A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}^{2}=\\{(A,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}^{2}=\\{(A,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{541}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{541}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Pr}^{541}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Pr A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Pr}^{541}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Pr A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可证性推广只作用于空依赖较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{541}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{541}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列四项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{541}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{541}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{541}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{541}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Pr}^{541}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Pr}^{541}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{541}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{541}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{541}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{541}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{541}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{541}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{541}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{541}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{541}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{541}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{541}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{541}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{541}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{541}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}\\)</span> 而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}\\)</span> 作为原始构造子，并把 Löb 族写成</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr(\\Pr A\\to A)\\to\\Pr A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{541}\n=\n\\{\\Pr(\\Pr A\\to A)\\to\\Pr A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同时显式加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{541}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{541}\\)</span> 作为可证性迭代族；不加入反身族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\Pr A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}\">\\(\\{\\Pr A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{541}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{GodelLob}_{541}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{541},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{541},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{541},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{541},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,541},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{541},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{541},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{541},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{541},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Pr}^{541},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{541},\n\\vdash_{541}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{GodelLob}_{541}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{541},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{541},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{541},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{541},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,541},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{541},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{541},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{541},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{541},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Pr}^{541},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{541},\n\\vdash_{541}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含命题可证性句法、公理族、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含算术编码、证明谓词解释、真值定义、模型、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{541}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{pr}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Pr A=\\operatorname{pr}(A),","display":true},{"te